stigo, pagado, castigado después o aún vigente, es un no evento: el archivo muestra un castigo como CHGOFF, nunca como crédito vigente. Un crédito observado menos de 60 meses y sin castigo (EXEMPT, vigente) es censurado por la derecha: no tiene resultado, se cuenta aparte y nunca se cuenta como vigente sano."}},"cohort_windows":[{"id":"fy2006-07","label":{"en":"FY2006-07","es":"AF2006-07"},"first_fy":2006,"last_fy":2007,"training":{"first_fy":1991,"last_fy":2000,"cutoff_date":"2005-09-30","n_loans":330682,"n_events":23320,"crisis_included":false,"rationale":{"en":"Approval fiscal years FY1991 to FY2000: the 5-year mark of FY2000 closes on 2005-09-30, before the first approval of FY2006-07 on 2005-10-01. 330,682 loans with a known 5-year outcome and 23,320 charge-offs; the rungs were fitted on a stratified sample of 40,000 of them. The window closes before the recession (December 2007): the model has seen no outcome of the crisis.","es":"Años fiscales de aprobación AF1991 a AF2000: la marca de 5 años de AF2000 cierra el 2005-09-30, antes de la primera aprobación de AF2006-07 el 2005-10-01. 330.682 créditos con resultado a 5 años conocido y 23.320 castigos; los peldaños se ajustaron con una muestra estratificada de 40.000 de ellos. La ventana cierra antes de la recesión (diciembre de 2007): el modelo no ha visto ningún resultado de la crisis."}}},{"id":"fy2008-10","label":{"en":"FY2008-10","es":"AF2008-10"},"first_fy":2008,"last_fy":2010,"training":{"first_fy":1991,"last_fy":2002,"cutoff_date":"2007-09-30","n_loans":413083,"n_events":28393,"crisis_included":false,"rationale":{"en":"Approval fiscal years FY1991 to FY2002: the 5-year mark of FY2002 closes on 2007-09-30, before the first approval of FY2008-10 on 2007-10-01. 413,083 loans with a known 5-year outcome and 28,393 charge-offs; the rungs were fitted on a stratified sample of 40,000 of them. The window closes before the recession (December 2007): the model has seen no outcome of the crisis.","es":"Años fiscales